</td><td class=\"taxonomy-field-title\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title standardLabel\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Bildirim İçeriği</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Announcement Content</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-10000_Material-Event-Disclosure-General-row-9 abstract-row\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationSection|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-field-title\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title standardLabel\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Açıklamalar</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Explanations</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-10000_Material-Event-Disclosure-General-row-10 data-input-row alternate-row presentation-enabled\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationTextBlock|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div>Sermaye Piyasası Kurulu'nun 27.10.2026 tarihli bülteninde yayınlanan &#160;ve Şirketimiz Pasifik Eurasia Lojistik Dış Ticaret A.Ş. (PASEU) pay piyasasında gerçekleştirilen işlemlere ilişkin inceleme sonuçlarını içeren duyuruda, bazı gerçek kişiler hakkında 6362 sayılı Sermaye Piyasası Kanunu'nun 107/1. maddesi kapsamında suç duyurusunda bulunulmasına karar verildiği açıklanmıştır.</div><div><br/></div><div>Söz konusu bültende yer alan suç duyurusu kararına ilişkin listede Şirketimizin tüzel kişiliği, yönetim kurulu üyeleri veya ortakları bulunmamaktadır.&#160;</div><div><br/></div><div>SPK tarafından yayımlanan bültende Şirketimizin ana ortakları ile yönetim organlarına yönelik bir tedbir kararının alınmamış olması; bu kapsamda şirket ana ortakları ve yönetiminin bir kusuru olmadığını göstermektedir.</div><div><br/></div><div>Bununla birlikte, Şirketimize &#160;ulaşan bilgilere göre Şirketimizin üç ortağına ait hesaplar hakkında adli mercilerce tedbir kararı uygulandığı öğrenilmiştir.</div><div><br/></div><div>Ortaklarımız, tedbirin kapsamının açıklığa kavuşturulması ve kaldırılması talebiyle yasal hakları çerçevesinde ilgili adli mercilere itirazda bulunmuştur.</div><div><br/></div><div>Konuya ilişkin önemli gelişmeler olması hâlinde mevzuat çerçevesinde kamuya açıklama yapılacaktır.</div><div><br/></div><div>Yatırımcılarımızın ve kamuoyunun bilgisine sunarız.</div></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div><div><div>In the announcement published in the bulletin of the Capital Markets Board of Türkiye (CMB) dated 27 October 2026, which sets out the findings of its review of transactions conducted in the share market of our Company, Pasifik Eurasia Logistics Foreign Trade Inc. (PASEU), it was disclosed that a decision had been taken to file criminal complaints against certain individuals pursuant to Article 107/1 of Capital Markets Law No. 6362.</div><div><br/></div><div>Neither our Company as a legal entity, nor its members of the Board of Directors or shareholders, are included in the list of persons subject to the criminal complaint decisions set out in the aforementioned bulletin.</div><div><br/></div><div>The fact that no precautionary measures have been imposed on our Company's principal shareholders or governing bodies in the bulletin published by the CMB indicates that no fault has been attributed to the Company's principal shareholders or management in this regard.</div><div><br/></div><div>Nevertheless, according to information received by our Company, precautionary measures have been imposed by the judicial authorities on accounts belonging to three of our shareholders.</div><div><br/></div><div>Our shareholders have filed objections with the relevant judicial authorities, in accordance with their legal rights, requesting clarification of the scope of the measures and their removal.</div><div><br/></div><div>Should any material developments arise in relation to this matter, public disclosures will be made in accordance with the applicable legislation.</div><div><br/></div><div>We hereby inform our investors and the public.</div><div>This statement has been translated into English for informational purposes. In case of a discrepancy between the Turkish and the English versions of this disclosure statement, the Turkish version shall prevail.</div></div></div><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>"],"attachments":[]}]